# CH3CH2NO2: 10 atoms, charge 0, multiplicity 1
# REOPTIMISATION. The first optimisation left one small imaginary frequency.
# Start: the previous optimised geometry with the NO2 group rotated by 12
# degrees about the C-N bond, so the optimiser leaves the saddle point.
# Tighter optimisation and SCF criteria and a finer integration grid.
# Writes CH3CH2NO2_opt.xyz for the single point.
! wB97X-D3 def2-TZVP TightOpt Freq VeryTightSCF DefGrid3
